<title>FRANCE: EU sells German intervention barley, rye.</title>
<headline>EU sells German intervention barley, rye.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday sold 3,885 tonnnes of German intervention barley at a minimum price of 97.87 Ecus per tonne for export to countries outside the EU, member-country officials said.</p>
<p>The EU also sold 13,692 tonnes of German intervention rye at a minimum price of 103.33 Ecus per tonne, they said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
